    <h2 id="v3.5.5">
      v3.5.5 <small><i>(2026-08-20)</i></small>
      <mark class="latest">Latest</mark>
    </h2>
    <h3>Security fixes:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Meower: Usernames are now truncated to 2 characters to mitigate a
        ScratchAttach exploit. Please use the
        <a
          href="https://scratch.mit.edu/cloudmonitor/365039244/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener">Cloud Monitor</a
        >
        to see full usernames.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="v3.5.4">
      v3.5.4 <small><i>(2025-09-09)</i></small>
    </h2>
    <h3>Changes & Improvements:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Improved layout of some apps</li>
      <li>The project can now run on mobile devices with Forkphorus</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="v3.5.3">
      v3.5.3 <small><i>(2024-10-20)</i></small>
    </h2>
    <h3>Development changes:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Apps from the store are now on the new codebase that was inroduced in{
          " "
        }
        <a href="#v3.5.0">v3.5.0</a> and easier to develop
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="v3.5.2">
      v3.5.2 <small><i>(2024-09-22)</i></small>
    </h2>
    <h3>Bug fixes:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Meower Chat: Clicking outside the New Message button should no longer
        trigger the message input box
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="v3.5.1">
      v3.5.1 <small><i>(2024-08-31)</i></small>
    </h2>
    <h3>Changes and improvements:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>The Load button now shows a badge indicating that it's loading</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Bug fixes:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Paint: Opening the app should no longer draw a dot at the mouse position
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="v3.5.0">
      v3.5.0 <small><i>(2024-06-22)</i></small>
    </h2>
    <h3>New features:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Music: New "Loop" button allows to play songs repeatedly</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Changes & improvements:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>New home screen animation</li>
      <li>
        Space Game: Background music will not play if there's a song already
        playing in the Music app
      </li>
      <li>The WiFi button now also displays the username</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Bug fixes:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Improved overall app performance</li>
      <li>
        Gobo Assistant: Fixed the speech bubble not hiding when clicking outside
        of it
      </li>
      <li>
        Calculator: Fixed the number fields not being hidden when going to the
        home screen
      </li>
      <li>
        Calculator: Fixed the number fields being cleared every time the app is
        launched
      </li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Removed features:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Removed drag&drop support for app icons <br /><i
          >Note: This removal is only temporary. It is planned to be re-added in
          the next release.</i
        >
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="v3.4.2">
      v3.4.2 <small><i>(2023-09-17)</i></small>
    </h2>
    <h3>Changes & improvements:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Improved positions and sizes of app icons</li>
      <li>Increased contrast of some items</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Bug fixes:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Fixed a bug that didn't allow leaving Meower Chat on some devices</li>
      <li>Fixed a bug that didn't uninstall apps on hard reset</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="v3.4.1">
      v3.4.1 <small><i>(2023-09-17)</i></small>
    </h2>
    <h3>Changes & improvements:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>App Store: Background now matches the system's color settings</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Bug fixes:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Fixed a bug that reset alarms on startup</li>
      <li>
        Fixed a bug that didn't allow to click the notifications button with
        "auto-hide taskbar" enabled
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="v3.4.0">
      v3.4.0 <small><i>(2023-09-13)</i></small>
    </h2>
    <h3>New features:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>
        New app: Speed tester (allows to run CPS, FPS, FLOPS, and Cloud speed
        tests)
      </li>
      <li>Data is no longer deleted at every startup</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Changes & improvements:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>The panel now has floating edges</li>
      <li>
        Translator: If no language is specified, it will use your Scratch
        language
      </li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Bug fixes:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Enabling turbo mode should no longer make the screen glitch</li>
      <li>Many other bug fixes regarding the system kernel</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Removed features:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Legacy speed test (use the new Speedtest app)</li>
      <li>Command line (was dangerous)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="v3.3.1">
      v3.3.1 <small><i>(2023-02-16)</i></small>
    </h2>
    <h3>Changes & improvements:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Light/dark mode doesn't affect the home screen anymore</li>
      <li>
        Added experimental support for forkphorus when pressing [x] on the error
        page
      </li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Bug fixes:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Fixed volume/internet displays not hiding when dismissing them</li>
      <li>Music: Fixed some songs not playing</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Removed features:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Paint: Removed Brightness slider because of issues with the Save/Load
        system (the feature is still available with Dev mode)
      </li>
    </ul>
    <br />

    <h2>
      v3.3.0 <small><i>(2023-02-08)</i></small>
    </h2>
    <h3>New features:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Re-added microphone volume display to Volume button in taskbar</li>
      <li>Music: Added ability to play/pause sounds</li>
      <li>Music: Added new song</li>
      <li>Paint: Added ability to change brightness and saturation</li>
      <!--<li>WiFi button now shows internet connection details (thanks @asesavagejr)</li>-->
    </ul>
    <h3>Changes and improvements:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Paint: Sliders now hide when clicking outside</li>
      <li>
        Now a warning is shown when trying to save a Notepad file containing
        placeholder strings
      </li>
      <li>Login is no longer required to use Dev mode</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Bug fixes:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Paint: Fixed some painting lines not saving</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Known issues:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Music pause only works properly on TurboWarp with
        <code>no-limits</code> enabled and on the web player
      </li>
    </ul>
    <br />

    <h2>
      v3.2.5 <small><i>(2022-12-15) </i></small>
    </h2>
    <h3>Changes & improvements:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Meower: Chat notifications are now shown in taskbar</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Bug fixes:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>SpaceGame: fixed background showing only in Color theme</li>
      <li>
        Fixed Network icon shwoing connection even when you're not logged in
      </li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Known issues:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Notepad + Translate: read aloud doesn't support more than 128
        characters.
      </li>
      <li>Gobo: voice output ignores actual volume</li>
      <li>
        Gobo: when <i>Auto-hide taskbar</i> is enabled, the Gobo icon is hidden even
        if the Gobo app is opened
      </li>
      <li>Calculator: exponents with point return wrong results</li>
    </ul>
    <br />

